    // Value:  	<paint> | inherit (See Specifying paint)
    // Initial:  	 none
    // Applies to:  	 shapes and text content elements
    // Inherited:  	 yes
    // Percentages:  	 N/A
    // Media:  	 visual
    // Animatable:  	 yes
